%% Kafka REST Proxy - Data Flow
%% Commit: 28ae7f33556978fa8ee59bab75b27301d1222622

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant RateLimit as Rate Limiter
    participant Resource as REST Resource
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Schema as Schema Manager
    participant SR as Schema Registry
    participant Backend as Kafka Backend
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker

    Note over Client,Kafka: Produce Flow (V3 API)

    Client->>RateLimit: POST /v3/clusters/.../records
    RateLimit->>RateLimit: Check global limits
    RateLimit->>RateLimit: Check per-cluster limits

    alt Rate limit exceeded
        RateLimit-->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests
    end

    RateLimit->>Resource: ProduceAction.produce()
    Resource->>Resource: Parse ProduceRequest

    alt Schema-based format
        Resource->>Schema: getSchema(subject, ...)
        Schema->>SR: GET /subjects/{subject}/versions/latest
        SR-->>Schema: Schema definition
        Schema-->>Resource: RegisteredSchema
        Resource->>Resource: Serialize with schema
    end

    Resource->>Controller: produce(clusterId, topic, ...)
    Controller->>Backend: getProducer()
    Backend-->>Controller: Producer<byte[], byte[]>
    Controller->>Kafka: producer.send(record)

    Kafka-->>Controller: RecordMetadata
    Controller-->>Resource: ProduceResult
    Resource-->>Client: Streaming JSON response
